      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她们的视线让我不太自在，\n不过还不至于去在意。\n毕竟这学园有转学生确实是很稀奇的事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5effde27ea43451c1cad0f75588e9266da855ad0f8d7509d1b82f70fbd0c8ecb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
