      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她那威风凛凛的言行举止，\n在转进来后仍丝毫没有改变。\n我这训练员也得学学她才行……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4121a03429e87598a9b9c5abbb1e7d8b6896bfd07ae052f1dbbe67c5d4ad25a",
